# gate/jsbar.script - hidden scripted boot into Kevin's J's Bar opening scene (M4 step 1, 2026-10-24).
# Run: PS2X_GS=pcsx2-sw PS2X_VU1=mvu bash tools/ob.sh boot --script gate/jsbar.script --tag <T>
# Steps up to Difficulty NORMAL are gate/play.script's (captures dropped). Loading runs in host time
# (reports/2026-10-23-gameplay.md entry 11), so the scene is anchored on guest state, not on a tick:
#   0x0048BF60 s8 = GAME main mode (func_005CD660 switch, jtbl_0070A700, en/game/text.s:163633-163650;
#     0x48BF61 = its sub-step, func_005CE2F0 en/game/text.s:164560-164567). Seen (boots jsprobe2, jsbar1/2):
#     0x0E room load (from 2841) -> 1 (NOW LOADING, ~4474) -> 2 at the first frame of the J's Bar scene
#     (~4931) -> 4 at the event demo 0x20 (~9132, 0x00360000 = 0x20, demo flag 0x0048BF88 = 1).
#   0x003065AA u16 = room number (the r%03d of the voice/lip/demo file names, sprintf at en/game/text.s:145783,
#     :306694, :144201); 1 from tick ~2845, the whole time in J's Bar.
# The first mode 2 after GAME.BIN is in is the scene start; jsbar-<k> covers its first ~5 s (300 frames, one per
#   tick on the 2026-10-24 build; ~2.1 ticks per frame on older builds). Also the gate's J's Bar set (gate/sets.json).
# Status (boots jsbar1, jsbar2, jsbar4, 2026-10-24): the anchor holds (mode 2 at tick 4911/4912, the fade-in
#   lines up), the camera is fixed for the whole capture, but the scene is NOT deterministic run to run:
#   the window zombies and the wounded man (right edge) differ from the first lit frame (by tick: share>8
#   ~0.007, max 56; best frame over a whole run 0.0054 against the frozen p 0.0001), and the dialogue starts
#   at different ticks (first line at +1102 in jsbar1, none by +2136 in jsbar2). Kevin and the room match.
#   Not gate-ready until that is explained (reports/2026-10-23-gameplay.md entry 28).
#   Against the developer's PCSX2 shot (2026-10-24, windows excluded): jsbar1/jsbar4 match, jsbar2 and the fresh
#   jsdet1/jsdet2 do not (dialogue and Cindy's entrance seconds early): reports/2026-10-24-jsbar-gate.md.
timeout 900
watch 0x0048BF60 2
watch 0x003065AA 2

log save-data screen (memory-card prompt): boot task step 1 sub 4
wait mem 0x002F85D8 2 == 0x0401
wait vsync 120
press left 8
wait vsync 30
press circle 8

log ACCESS logo: boot task step 1 sub 9 (128 vsyncs)
wait mem 0x002F85D8 2 == 0x0901
wait vsync 100

log CAPCOM logo: title state 0 sub 0 step 1
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00010000
wait vsync 120

log title PRESS START: title state 0 sub 2 step 3
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00030200
wait vsync 120
press start 8

log main menu input wait: title state 1 sub 5 step 5
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00050501
wait vsync 60
press circle 8

log single-play entry screen: title state 2 sub 2 step 2
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00020202
wait vsync 60
press circle 8

log Scenario Select: select state 8 (t4dbg boot)
wait mem *0x003065FC+4 1 == 8
wait vsync 120
press circle 8

log character select: select state 9 (10/11 = Difficulty)
wait mem *0x003065FC+4 1 == 9
wait vsync 90
press circle 8
wait vsync 60

log select state 11 = Difficulty (EASY/NORMAL); state 10 passes in 2 ticks (play1 watch)
wait mem *0x003065FC+4 1 == 11
wait vsync 90
press circle 8
wait vsync 60

log game task installed in slot 4 (func_005CD580, GAME.BIN)
wait mem 0x002F8654 4 == 0x005CD580
log GAME.BIN in 0x540000
wait mem 0x00239F30 1 == 2
log J's Bar room (room number 1)
wait mem 0x003065AA 2 == 1
log J's Bar opening scene: GAME main mode 2 (first frame of the scene)
wait mem 0x0048BF60 1 == 2
capture jsbar 300
quit
